description	"Dezanti Zhug

Half of the Zhug Duros Gang leadership, Dezanti Devotes himself to heavy weaponry and makeshift bombs to range out his opponents and pulls out his axe and inner rage in final stands.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
- Zhug Rapid Blaster Pistol (1)
-- 45%- Damage/50%+ RoF
- Zhug Heavy Repeater 
-- E-22 (3)
-- 20% More Damage, 10%+ RoF
-- Mag Reload, Cripple on Hit
-- 15%- Slower Movement
- Handcrafted Battle Axe
-- Red and Yellow Style
-- Stuns / 130 Damage
-- Saber Defense (1) and Blaster Defense (0)
- Makeshift Flame Grenades (2)
- Frag Nade, Inflict Flame, 10% More Damage

^8Attributes:
- Enforcer Strength (2)
- Rally
- Beskar Chest Plate (1)
- Blast Armor
- Focused (Anti-Mind Trick 1)

^8Abilities:
- Repair Armor (Armor Dispenser 1) ^3[USE in Melee]
- Shoulder Barge ^3[CS1]
- Grapple Hook ^3[CS4]
- Combat Stim Injection ^3[CS3]
- Verpine Combat Shield ^3[CS4]"